# libFuzzer writes what it discovers into the same directories the
# regression corpus lives in, naming every input by the SHA-1 of its
# content. Those forty characters are the mark: the regression corpus of
# D-54 is named in words, one file per case a test cites, and is tracked;
# what a run finds is reproducible by another run and is not.
